@startuml
title System Failover & Recovery Flow

participant LoadBalancer
participant PrimaryAPI
participant SecondaryAPI
participant HealthMonitor
participant DatabaseReplica
participant MQ

== Normal Operation ==

LoadBalancer -> PrimaryAPI: Route Requests
PrimaryAPI -> DatabaseReplica: Read/Write Ops

== Failure Detection ==

HealthMonitor -> PrimaryAPI: Health Check Ping
PrimaryAPI --> HealthMonitor: No Response

HealthMonitor -> LoadBalancer: Trigger Failover

== Failover Activation ==

LoadBalancer -> SecondaryAPI: Switch Traffic

SecondaryAPI -> DatabaseReplica: Sync State Check
DatabaseReplica --> SecondaryAPI: Sync OK

SecondaryAPI -> MQ: Resume Processing Queues

SecondaryAPI --> LoadBalancer: Service Active

== Recovery ==

PrimaryAPI -> HealthMonitor: Restarted
HealthMonitor -> LoadBalancer: Restore Primary (optional)

@enduml